    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/ea54a703540e2dbb6bff6ae2e87f416e.webp?t=1748558799\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Explore and document the ancient homeworld of <strong>EMUUROM </strong>before it's lost forever<strong>. </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover rules, gather information, and use the gained knowledge to find new paths forward. There are a plethora of secrets hidden in plain sight: as you gain a better understanding on the world around you, the hidden machinations of the EMUUROM creatures begin to unfold...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/7b11951a46f87cb4cdaa76be821121fe.poster.avif?t=1748558799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/7b11951a46f87cb4cdaa76be821121fe.webm?t=1748558799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/7b11951a46f87cb4cdaa76be821121fe.mp4?t=1748558799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Study creatures and reveal hidden pathways with a\u00a0<strong><i>scanner beam</i></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse a dense land full of puzzles ranging from obvious to obscure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/a7ab656b97b34f19242e36bf9a76940e.poster.avif?t=1748558799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/a7ab656b97b34f19242e36bf9a76940e.webm?t=1748558799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/a7ab656b97b34f19242e36bf9a76940e.mp4?t=1748558799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Document your findings in the <strong><i>EMUUDEX</i></strong>, and recall past findings at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No power-ups! Use the creatures' systemic behaviour to get around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/272c96705c27a8d273f0cc520e0b7363.poster.avif?t=1748558799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/272c96705c27a8d273f0cc520e0b7363.webm?t=1748558799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/272c96705c27a8d273f0cc520e0b7363.mp4?t=1748558799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique retro look and structure arising from the fantasy console restrictions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No hand-holding! It's up to your wits to figure out the workings of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/71955ec6ee3c8570104a296dc9909af9.poster.avif?t=1748558799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/71955ec6ee3c8570104a296dc9909af9.webm?t=1748558799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/71955ec6ee3c8570104a296dc9909af9.mp4?t=1748558799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EMBEDDED MESSAGE ????? THE ??????</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Ask the ????????'s\u00a0way</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>and go willingly astray</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>and the peaceful creatures</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>EMUUROM shall roam again</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/ea54a703540e2dbb6bff6ae2e87f416e.webp?t=1748558799\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Explore and document the ancient homeworld of <strong>EMUUROM </strong>before it's lost forever<strong>. </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover rules, gather information, and use the gained knowledge to find new paths forward. There are a plethora of secrets hidden in plain sight: as you gain a better understanding on the world around you, the hidden machinations of the EMUUROM creatures begin to unfold...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/7b11951a46f87cb4cdaa76be821121fe.poster.avif?t=1748558799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/7b11951a46f87cb4cdaa76be821121fe.webm?t=1748558799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/7b11951a46f87cb4cdaa76be821121fe.mp4?t=1748558799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Study creatures and reveal hidden pathways with a\u00a0<strong><i>scanner beam</i></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse a dense land full of puzzles ranging from obvious to obscure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/a7ab656b97b34f19242e36